WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:03.337
♪♪

00:00:03.337 --> 00:00:06.840
Dad, why are you doing
this to us?

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:08.091
♪♪

00:00:08.091 --> 00:00:09.551
Dina:
Why is it such a big secret?

00:00:09.551 --> 00:00:11.053
♪♪

00:00:11.053 --> 00:00:12.638
Sh-shh...
(Sirens wail)

00:00:12.638 --> 00:00:15.724
Because we have a problem.

00:00:15.724 --> 00:00:17.809
♪♪

00:00:17.809 --> 00:00:19.603
What kind of problem?

00:00:19.603 --> 00:00:20.979
(Tires skidding)

00:00:20.979 --> 00:00:23.398
Allie:
You know the kind of problem,
that you think, Okay,

00:00:23.899 --> 00:00:25.734
first glance, that looks pretty
bad.

00:00:25.734 --> 00:00:27.361
Margot (whispers):
The kids could get hurt.

00:00:27.361 --> 00:00:29.404
They're not gonna get hurt.
They're with us.

00:00:29.404 --> 00:00:31.198
Ooh, that's what I'm worried
about.

00:00:31.198 --> 00:00:32.199
♪♪

00:00:32.199 --> 00:00:34.451
If I just sit down and think
about it.

00:00:34.451 --> 00:00:36.245
♪♪

00:00:36.245 --> 00:00:37.246
(Car door shuts)

00:00:37.246 --> 00:00:38.956
Allie:
I might be able to figure a way
out of it.

00:00:38.956 --> 00:00:40.624
♪♪

00:00:40.624 --> 00:00:42.834
We don't have that kind of
problem.

00:00:42.834 --> 00:00:45.128
♪♪

00:00:45.128 --> 00:00:46.838
Allie:
We make the move

00:00:46.838 --> 00:00:47.881
Allie:
and we start again.

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:50.842
♪♪

00:00:50.842 --> 00:00:51.843
Wait.

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:57.516
♪♪

00:00:57.516 --> 00:00:58.934
This is gonna be an adventure.

00:00:58.934 --> 00:01:00.644
♪♪

00:01:00.644 --> 00:01:01.645
Dina:
I'm scared.

00:01:01.645 --> 00:01:03.730
♪♪

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:04.731
Absolutely.

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:05.732
♪♪

00:01:05.732 --> 00:01:06.817
(Sirens wail)
♪♪

00:01:06.817 --> 00:01:07.943
If it didn't feel that way.

00:01:07.943 --> 00:01:11.363
♪♪

00:01:11.363 --> 00:01:13.407
It wouldn't be an adventure.

00:01:13.407 --> 00:01:14.616
(Sirens wail)

00:01:14.616 --> 00:01:16.493
Allie:
We need to go.

00:01:16.493 --> 00:01:17.494
Come on.

00:01:17.494 --> 00:01:20.998
(Sirens wail)
♪♪

